WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:22,670
How long has Ling Feng stayed all afternoon?

2
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,620
Sit down, please have a meal

3
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,660
Come to me, there are three main things

4
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,860
The first Mrs. Bai’s medicine

5
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,020
The room line of the second night

6
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,020
I have to discuss this with you.

7
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,540
The third thing about the wild boar

8
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:00,540
Do you have any conditions?

9
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,860
1. I have the final say on hunting.

10
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,060
No one is allowed to enter the Western Slope without permission

11
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:06,620
2. Invite Jiang Yue to talk about it. Jiang Yue is coming too.

12
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:07,740
3. Meat divided according to output

13
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:08,980
Who wants to lie down and divide the meat without getting a bite?

14
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,420
The meat needs to be marinated, and you need to use salt to marinate it.

15
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:11,580
You provide the manpower and she provides the salt.

16
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:12,820
No one will suffer if I sacrifice my life

17
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,640
Okay, I'll take a breath tonight and bring all the sword flowers with me.

18
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,160
If she doesn't come, the game will be over.
